flowchart TD
    A[Customer request + date] --> B(OrchestratorAgent)
    B -->|1. check stock| C(InventoryAgent)
    B -->|2. get quote| D(QuotingAgent)
    B -->|3. place order| E(OrderingAgent)

    C -->|list_catalog tool reads paper_supplies| F[(SQLite database)]
    C -->|check_stock tool uses get_stock_level| F
    C -->|list_inventory tool uses get_all_inventory| F
    C -->|reorder_if_low tool uses get_stock_level + create_transaction| F

    D -->|list_catalog and get_price tools read paper_supplies| F
    D -->|past_quotes tool uses search_quote_history| F

    E -->|check_finances tool uses generate_financial_report| F
    E -->|sell_item tool uses get_stock_level| G{Enough stock?}
    E -->|restock_item tool uses get_supplier_delivery_date + get_cash_balance| I{Enough cash and in time?}

    G -->|Yes| H[Record sale with create_transaction]
    G -->|No| E
    I -->|Yes| J[Order from supplier with create_transaction]
    I -->|No| K[Reject with reason]

    H --> F
    J --> F

    B -->|4. quote + order outcome| L[Reply to customer]
    K --> L
